<mxfile host="Electron"><diagram name="시스템" id="시스템"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1030" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2560" pageHeight="2020" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t" value="STORM — 가격변동 인과귀속 심층연구 시스템" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=28;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="26" width="1900" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="DataSTORM(arXiv 2604.06474) 을 가격 인과귀속에 이식.  v1 실패 원인 = 가설·검정 공간을 대수로 강제한 것 → 여기서는 형식 제약을 제거하고 &lt;b&gt;PIT 방화벽·반증·실현가격 채점&lt;/b&gt;으로 대체한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="66" width="2100" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fw" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=none;opacity=12;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2300" y="200" width="200" height="1330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fw_t" value="PIT 방화벽  τ = as_of" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#b85450;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2318" y="216" width="170" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fw_b" value="설명 대상 시각 τ 이후의&lt;br&gt;모든 것을 차단한다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· 사건: available_at ≤ τ&lt;br&gt;· 가격: 종료봉 ≤ τ&lt;br&gt;· 실현 결과 r₁·r₂·route&lt;br&gt;  → 탐색 단계 &lt;b&gt;비공개&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  (채점에서만 열림)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· 정답 라벨 daum_*&lt;br&gt;  → 영구 차단 (LabelLeak)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DataSTORM 에 없는 층.&lt;br&gt;이게 없으면 미래를 보고&lt;br&gt;설명하게 된다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2318" y="250" width="172" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fw_b2" value="&lt;b&gt;디코이 혼입 ~10%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;실제로 사건이 없는 셀을&lt;br&gt;섞어 넣는다. 설명을&lt;br&gt;지어내는지 잡는 장치.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(prediction-pipeline-v1&lt;br&gt; L3 방화벽 규약과 동일)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2318" y="600" width="172" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#aaaaaa;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 6;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="200" width="2200" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l0_t" value="L0  결정론 기반 — LLM 없음.  여기 값은 코드가 만든다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="208" width="2168" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d1" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px&quot;&gt;이벤트 스토어 interim&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;v3 · 39,959 사건 · 53타입&lt;br&gt;event_argument 76,020&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;쓰레딩 76% UNKNOWN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;라벨 daum_* 차단&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="78" y="250" width="250" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px&quot;&gt;가격 5분봉&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;1,270종목 · 2022-11~2026-07&lt;br&gt;일별패널 455,984행&lt;br&gt;KOSPI200 · 시총 · 섹터&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="250" width="230" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d3" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px&quot;&gt;온톨로지&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;53타입 · 20 라이프사이클&lt;br&gt;roles / note(자매경계)&lt;br&gt;quantities · &lt;b&gt;derived 공식&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="250" width="230" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dec" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;분해  EXP-002&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;r₁ = r₀ − βₘrₘ − aₘ        |r₁|/σ₁&lt;2 → market&lt;br&gt;r⊥p = ⅓Σ³pₖ − βₙₘrₘ − aₙₘ   (구성종목의 상관 top-3)&lt;br&gt;r₂ = r₁ − β⊥p·r⊥p − a⊥p     &lt;2 → thema  ≥2 → concentrated&lt;br&gt;N=252 · arm=ind · 실측 R²m 68.8% · ΔR²⊥ +23.2%&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="866" y="244" width="560" height="128" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dec_b" value="검증됨" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#82b366;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1362" y="233" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="warm" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;warm-start  r₀&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;DataSTORM 은 Co-STORM 웹검색으로 만들지만&lt;br&gt;우리는 &lt;b&gt;결정론 산출&lt;/b&gt;이 그 자리를 대신한다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· route + r₁ · r₂ · z&lt;br&gt;· 구성종목 기여(비중×등락) · top3 집중도&lt;br&gt;· PIT 창 사건 목록(잘림 표시)&lt;br&gt;· 결손·품질 플래그&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1456" y="244" width="380" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tgt" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;설명 대상  q&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;concentrated 로 라우팅된&lt;br&gt;ETF-일 또는 종목-일&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실측 271 ETF-일&lt;br&gt;셀당 사건 중앙 1,062건&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;사건 밀도가 라우트를&lt;br&gt;구분 못 한다&lt;/b&gt; → 자명한&lt;br&gt;기준선이 없다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="244" width="350" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tgt_b" value="입력" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2152" y="233" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l0n" value="과제의 실제 모양:  수천 건 중 &lt;b&gt;어느 구성종목의 어느 사건&lt;/b&gt;이 이 움직임을 만들었는가" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#3d6e28;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="878" y="470" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#f4f8ff;strokeColor=#8ba9cc;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 6;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="560" width="2200" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l1_t" value="L1  다중 에이전트 탐색 — layer i = 1 … m   (각 층이 B_{i-1}, t_{i-1} 을 받아 B_i 를 낸다)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#3f6389;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="568" width="2168" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="plan" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;① Planner&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;탐색 질문 n개 생성 (형식 자유)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;입력  B_{i-1} 근거은행 · t_{i-1} 논제&lt;br&gt;       i=1 이면 warm-start r₀&lt;br&gt;출력  q_{i,1..n} + 각 질문의 &lt;b&gt;행선지&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;       DB / 가격 / 웹&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;연역 축. 무엇을 물을지만 정하고&lt;br&gt;답은 찾지 않는다 (EDA 분리 원칙)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="612" width="400" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="plan_b" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6c8ebf;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="416" y="601" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cons" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;② Query Consistency&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;가지끼리 기준이 어긋나는 것을 막는다&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;입력  (q_{i,j}, s_{i,j}) + B_{i-1} 의 기존 질의&lt;br&gt;출력  정렬된 후속질문 q′_{i,j}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;이 도메인에서 반드시 맞춰야 할 것:&lt;br&gt;· PIT 창 정의 (T−5 ~ τ)&lt;br&gt;· 티커 규약 (다종목 사건 n_org&gt;1)&lt;br&gt;· 수익률 규약 (로그 · 종가대비)&lt;br&gt;· 사건 중복 (쓰레딩 깨져 있음)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="612" width="400" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cons_b" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6c8ebf;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="856" y="601" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="exec" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;③ Executor  ×n 병렬&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;ReAct NL2SQL · &lt;b&gt;격리 컨텍스트&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;`storm/ask.py` · 최대 5턴&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;입력  q′ 하나&lt;br&gt;출력  a′ = 자연어 답 + 근거 SQL&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;관측에 &lt;b&gt;열 요약통계&lt;/b&gt;가 함께 실린다&lt;br&gt;`threads.profile()` — distinct% · 상위5&lt;br&gt;수치열 min/max/mean/median&lt;br&gt;→ 묻지 않은 패턴이 눈에 걸린다 (귀납 축)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="612" width="400" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="exec_b" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1296" y="601" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="qexec" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;④ Quant Executor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;SQL 로 못 하는 가격 검정. 코드 실행&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· 사건 시각 ↔ 5분봉 정렬 (선행/지연)&lt;br&gt;· 거래량 이상&lt;br&gt;· 같은 창 다른 종목 반사실&lt;br&gt;· 스레드 재발 시 반응 일관성&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;무엇을 볼지는 이 에이전트가 정한다.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;목록을 주지 않는다 — v1 편향 B6&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="612" width="400" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="qexec_b" value="LLM+코드" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1736" y="601" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bank" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;⑤ Insight Bank  B_i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;층마다 통합·교체&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· 새 근거를 기존과 병합&lt;br&gt;· 상한 유지, 약한 것은 밀려남&lt;br&gt;· 각 근거는 (주장, 수치, SQL/코드, 출처) 로 보관&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;다음 층 Planner 의 입력이 된다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="612" width="370" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="thes" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;⑥ Thesis  t_i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;p개 층마다 갱신 — 서사가 아니라 &lt;b&gt;인과 주장&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;주장 = &quot;무엇이 · 어떤 경로로 · 이 움직임을 만들었나&quot;&lt;br&gt;반드시 갖춰야 할 것:&lt;br&gt;  · 지목 (어느 구성종목의 어느 event_id)&lt;br&gt;  · 경로 (그것이 가격에 닿는 메커니즘)&lt;br&gt;  · &lt;b&gt;반증 조건&lt;/b&gt; (무엇이 관측되면 이 주장이 틀리나)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="870" width="840" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="thes_b" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d6b656;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="856" y="859" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="adv" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;⑦ Adversary&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;별도 컨텍스트.&lt;/b&gt; 논제를 죽이러 온다&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;입력  t_i + B_i (자기 추론 이력 없음)&lt;br&gt;출력  ㉠ 반례 · ㉡ 대안 설명 · ㉢ 범위 축소 요구&lt;br&gt;       ㉣ 생존 판정&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;자기 가설을 자기 컨텍스트에서 반증하면&lt;br&gt;형식적 반증만 나온다 → 컨텍스트를 끊는다&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;기각 시 Planner 로 되돌아간다 (최대 2왕복)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="870" width="500" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="adv_b" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1396" y="859" width="62" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stop" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;정지 규칙&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;· 층 상한 m&lt;br&gt;· Interpreter↔Adversary 왕복 2회&lt;br&gt;· 도구 호출 상한&lt;br&gt;· 수렴 실패 → &lt;b&gt;UNCERTAIN 으로 종료&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;정직 &gt; 커버리지&quot; — 억지 설명 금지&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="870" width="350" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="unc" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;UNCERTAIN&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;설명 없음으로 게시.&lt;br&gt;채점에서 &lt;b&gt;0 bit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(이득도 손해도 없음)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;모르는 것에 침묵하는 것이&lt;br&gt;허용된 전략이다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1890" y="870" width="320" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="loopn" value="↻  층 반복:  Planner → Consistency → Executor → Bank → (p층마다) Thesis → Adversary" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#3f6389;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1085" width="1400" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#f7f4fb;strokeColor=#a68cc0;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 6;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1290" width="2200" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l2_t" value="L2  보고 생성 — 5단 편집 파이프라인 (DataSTORM 3.3)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#6b4f8f;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1298" width="2168" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r0" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;A  개요&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;절마다 서사 목적 ·&lt;br&gt;필요 근거 Bˢ ⊆ B ·&lt;br&gt;핵심 논점&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1340" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;B  절 초안&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;절마다 &lt;b&gt;독립&lt;/b&gt; 작성.&lt;br&gt;자기 근거 부분집합에만&lt;br&gt;접지&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="1340" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;C  사실검증&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;인용 경계로 쪼개&lt;br&gt;문장 단위 검증.&lt;br&gt;미지지 주장 표시&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="1340" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;D  수정&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;수집된 비판으로&lt;br&gt;절을 고쳐 쓴다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1340" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r4" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px&quot;&gt;E  통합·윤문&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;절을 합쳐 최종&lt;br&gt;설명 패킷&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="1340" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l2n" value="한 번에 쓰면 인용 없는 주장·인용 나열·서사 붕괴가 난다 — 논문이 관측한 실패 양상이다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b4f8f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1900" y="1400" width="330" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#f4fbf4;strokeColor=#8fbf82;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 6;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1570" width="2450" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l3_t" value="L3  채점 — 사람 라벨이 아니라 &lt;b&gt;실현 가격&lt;/b&gt;이 정답이다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#3d6e28;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1578" width="2418" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="val" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;가치 함수&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;인과 정답은 관측되지 않는다(반사실 부재).&lt;br&gt;주장이 인과적이라면 &lt;b&gt;본 적 없는 셀에서도 성립&lt;/b&gt;해야 한다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   가치 = (1/|S|) Σ_{c∈S} log₂ [ p_주장(y_c) / p₀(y_c) ]   [bit/셀]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;y_c = 실현 결과 · p₀ = 무조건부 · S = 주장이 선언한 적용 범위&lt;br&gt;적정 채점규칙 → &lt;b&gt;확신 부풀리기가 손해&lt;/b&gt;. 기권은 0 bit.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1622" width="700" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="base" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;기준선&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;· 무조건부 p₀ — 정의상 0 bit&lt;br&gt;· 결정론 분해만 (LLM 없음)&lt;br&gt;· 디코이 셀에서의 오탐률&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v1 의 daum_mat AUC 는 쓰지 않는다.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;그건 주석자 흉내내기였다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="1622" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ledg" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;예측 원장 · 피드백&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;카드 발행 → 만기 → 실측 대조 → 오차 원장 → 프라이어 갱신&lt;br&gt;등급 라벨: 진예측(발행 해시 봉인) / 실황 / 그림자&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;병목 히스토그램 → 다음 수집 투자 라우팅&lt;br&gt;(prediction-pipeline-v1 의 L4·L5·L6 에 접속)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="1622" width="560" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gate" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;수용 게이트&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #333333&quot;&gt;· bit/셀 CI 가 0 초과&lt;br&gt;· 디코이 오탐 &lt; 기준&lt;br&gt;· 지목한 event_id 가&lt;br&gt;  PIT 창 안에 있음&lt;br&gt;· 반증 조건이 명시됨&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1880" y="1622" width="330" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l3n" value="DataSTORM 은 참조 기사 대비 LLM-judge 로 채점한다. 우리는 그럴 참조가 없다 — 대신 &lt;b&gt;가격이 채점한다&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3d6e28;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1850" width="1400" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d1" target="dec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d2" target="dec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dec" target="warm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;" edge="1" parent="1" source="warm" target="tgt"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="warm-start" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="warm" target="plan"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1646" y="530"/><mxPoint x="280" y="530"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="q" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="plan" target="cons"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="q′" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cons" target="exec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cons" target="qexec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1600" y="590"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="a′" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="exec" target="bank"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="qexec" target="bank"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="B_i" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bank" target="thes"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2230" y="845"/><mxPoint x="500" y="845"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="t_i" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="thes" target="adv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="기각 → 재탐색" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="adv" target="plan"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1210" y="1140"/><mxPoint x="280" y="1140"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="adv" target="stop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="미수렴" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stop" target="unc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="생존 t_m, B_m" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="adv" target="r0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1210" y="1250"/><mxPoint x="245" y="1250"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r0" target="r1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r1" target="r2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r2" target="r3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r3" target="r4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="설명 패킷" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r4" target="val"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2260" y="1500"/><mxPoint x="430" y="1500"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="0 bit" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="unc" target="val"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2050" y="1560"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="val" target="ledg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ledg" target="gate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="에이전트" id="에이전트"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1030" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2620" pageHeight="1980" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t" value="에이전트 상세 계약" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=28;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="26" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="7 에이전트.  각 칸의 &quot;v1 실패&quot; 는 이번 설계가 무엇을 고치는지다 — 편향 대장 §3 의 B1~B7 에 대응한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="66" width="1800" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7196;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="120" width="800" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#4a7196;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="120" width="800" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1n" value="① Planner" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="128" width="650" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1k" value="LLM · 연역 축" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="708" y="132" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l176" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="176" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b176" value="탐색 질문을 만든다. 답은 찾지 않는다.&lt;br&gt;EDA 의 &quot;질문 생성&quot;과 &quot;답 탐색&quot; 분리 원칙." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="176" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l220" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="220" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b220" value="i=1 : warm-start r₀ (분해 결과 · 기여 · PIT 창 사건)&lt;br&gt;i&gt;1 : 근거은행 B_{i-1} + 논제 t_{i-1} + Adversary 지적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="220" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l264" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="264" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b264" value="q_{i,1..n} — 자연어 질문 n개 + 각 질문의 행선지&lt;br&gt;행선지 = DB(이벤트) | 가격 | 웹" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="264" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l308" value="형식" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="308" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b308" value="&lt;b&gt;없음.&lt;/b&gt; 질문 템플릿·가설 폼·검정 폼을 주지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="308" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l336" value="컨텍스트" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="336" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b336" value="층 누적. 은행과 논제를 보되 Executor 내부 추론은 못 본다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="336" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l364" value="예산" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="364" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b364" value="층당 질문 n (1층 2, 이후 5) · 층 상한 m" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="364" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1l392" value="실패모드" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="392" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1b392" value="질문이 서로 겹침 → 은행 통합에서 밀려남&lt;br&gt;질문이 카드 재진술 → Executor 가 같은 SQL 을 반복" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="392" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="534" width="776" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1nt" value="v1 실패 B1·B3 — 가설을 (B,q,agg,h) 대수로 강제했더니 검정 가능 명제가 &quot;뉴스 개수·모양이 특이한가&quot; 로 붕괴했다. 산문 가설은 &quot;수주가 매출에 닿는다&quot; 인데 검정은 n_roles 개수였다. 이제 질문에 형식이 없다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72" y="542" width="752" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7196;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="120" width="780" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#4a7196;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="120" width="780" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2n" value="② Query Consistency" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="896" y="128" width="630" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2k" value="LLM · 정합" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="132" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2l176" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="176" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2b176" value="병렬 가지가 서로 비교 불가능한 답을 내는 것을 막는다.&lt;br&gt;다른 결론이 &quot;기준이 달라서&quot; 생긴 착시가 아님을 보장." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="176" width="672" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2l220" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="220" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2b220" value="(질문 q_{i,j}, 실행된 SQL s_{i,j}) 쌍 전량 + B_{i-1} 의 기존 질의" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="220" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2l248" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="248" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2b248" value="정렬 후속질문 q′_{i,j} → Executor 재실행" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="248" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2l276" value="이 도메인에서&lt;br&gt;맞춰야 할 것" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="276" width="74" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2b276" value="· PIT 창 정의 — T−5 ~ τ 로 통일했는가&lt;br&gt;· 티커 규약 — 다종목 사건(n_org&gt;1) 을 대표 1종목으로 봤나 전량인가&lt;br&gt;· 수익률 규약 — 로그/단순, 종가대비/일중&lt;br&gt;· 사건 중복 — 쓰레딩 76% UNKNOWN 이라 같은 사건이 여러 건으로 샘" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="276" width="672" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2l352" value="예산" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a7196;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="352" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2b352" value="층당 1회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="352" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="892" y="542" width="756" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2nt" value="ACLED 에서 actor1/assoc_actor_1 을 가지마다 다르게 필터하면 전혀 다른 집계가 나온다 — 논문이 든 예다. 우리 쪽 등가물이 위 4가지다. 특히 쓰레딩이 깨져 있어 &quot;같은 사건을 몇 건으로 세는가&quot; 가 가지마다 갈린다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="904" y="550" width="732" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7b5ba6;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1692" y="120" width="880" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#7b5ba6;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1692" y="120" width="880" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3n" value="③ Executor" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1708" y="128" width="730" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3k" value="LLM · ReAct · 격리" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2432" y="132" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l176" value="구현" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="176" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b176" value="`storm/ask.py` — 최대 5턴 · DeepSeek + 디스크 캐시" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="176" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l204" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="204" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b204" value="질문 하나를 SQL 로 답한다. 스키마 뉘앙스는 루프로 푼다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="204" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l232" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="232" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b232" value="q′ 하나. &lt;b&gt;다른 가지의 맥락을 받지 않는다&lt;/b&gt; (격리 컨텍스트)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="232" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l260" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="260" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b260" value="a′ = 자연어 답 + 근거 SQL s′" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="260" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l288" value="도구" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="288" width="74" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b288" value="`threads.run(sql)` → 표 + &lt;b&gt;열 요약통계&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  distinct% · null · 상위5값 · 수치열 min/max/mean/median&lt;br&gt;`threads.schema()` → 스키마 카드 + &lt;b&gt;함정 목록&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="288" width="772" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l348" value="귀납 축" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="348" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b348" value="통계가 답에 딸려 나가므로 Planner 가 &lt;b&gt;묻지 않은 패턴&lt;/b&gt;을 본다.&lt;br&gt;(최대값이 평균보다 크게 높다 → 다음 층에서 그 달을 판다)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#3d6e28;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="348" width="772" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l392" value="차단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="392" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b392" value="라벨 daum_* · golden_cell — 쿼리 텍스트와 결과 열이름 양쪽에서" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="392" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3l420" value="실패모드" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="420" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3b420" value="없는 열을 지어냄 → 스키마 카드로 억제&lt;br&gt;절단면(5,000행)에서 통계를 내고 전수인 척 → 경고 문구 자동 삽입" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="420" width="772" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1704" y="542" width="856" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3nt" value="v1 실패 B2 — 프롬프트에 &quot;파일 쓰지 마라 · 스크립트 짜지 마라 · JSON 하나만&quot; 을 박아 도구와 반복을 금지했다. 그건 단발 LLM 호출이었고, 그걸로 &quot;에이전트는 값어치 없다&quot; 고 결론냈다. 이제 ReAct 루프가 기본이다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1716" y="550" width="832" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7b5ba6;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="660" width="800" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#7b5ba6;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="660" width="800" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4n" value="④ Quant Executor" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="668" width="650" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4k" value="LLM + 코드 실행" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="708" y="672" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l716" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="716" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b716" value="SQL 로 표현 안 되는 가격 검정. 무엇을 볼지는 &lt;b&gt;스스로&lt;/b&gt; 정한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="716" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l744" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="744" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b744" value="가격 행선지 질문 + 대상 셀 + PIT 창" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="744" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l772" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="772" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b772" value="통계 + &lt;b&gt;재현 코드&lt;/b&gt;. 수치는 코드가 낸다 (자기보고 금지)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="772" width="692" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l800" value="도구" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="800" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b800" value="5분봉 1,270종목 · 일별패널 · KOSPI200 · 시총·섹터&lt;br&gt;분해 산출(단, τ 이후 실현값은 방화벽)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="800" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l844" value="가능해진 것" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="844" width="74" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b844" value="· 사건 시각 ↔ 5분봉 정렬 (반응이 사건 후에 왔나 · 선반영인가)&lt;br&gt;· 거래량 이상&lt;br&gt;· 같은 창 다른 종목 반사실&lt;br&gt;· 스레드 재발 시 반응 일관성" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="844" width="692" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4l920" value="금지" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="920" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b920" value="&lt;b&gt;고려 사항 목록을 주지 않는다.&lt;/b&gt; 위는 가능한 것의 예시일 뿐&lt;br&gt;프롬프트에 넣지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="920" width="692" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1064" width="776" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4nt" value="v1 실패 B6 — 인과 서명 4종(시간선행·예측력·반사실·반복)을 생성자에게 제시해 가설 공간을 미리 좁혔다. 그건 검정자가 스스로 고를 재료다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72" y="1072" width="752" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c19a2e;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="660" width="780" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#c19a2e;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="660" width="780" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5n" value="⑥ Thesis" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="896" y="668" width="630" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5k" value="LLM · p층마다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="672" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l716" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="716" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b716" value="흩어진 근거를 하나의 &lt;b&gt;인과 주장&lt;/b&gt;으로 모은다.&lt;br&gt;논문의 &quot;central insight&quot; 를 인과귀속용으로 강화한 것." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="716" width="672" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l760" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="760" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b760" value="근거은행 B_p (+ 직전 논제)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="760" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l788" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="788" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b788" value="논제 t_p — 다음 층 탐색을 조종한다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="788" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l816" value="반드시&lt;br&gt;갖출 것" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="816" width="74" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b816" value="· &lt;b&gt;지목&lt;/b&gt; — 어느 구성종목의 어느 event_id&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;경로&lt;/b&gt; — 그것이 가격에 닿는 메커니즘&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;크기 구간&lt;/b&gt; — 얼마나 (구간으로. 점추정 금지)&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;반증 조건&lt;/b&gt; — 무엇이 관측되면 이 주장이 틀리나" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="816" width="672" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l892" value="없으면" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="892" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b892" value="반증 조건이 없는 주장은 Adversary 가 자동 기각한다.&lt;br&gt;서사는 되지만 인과 주장은 아니기 때문." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="892" width="672" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5l936" value="갱신" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#c19a2e;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="936" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5b936" value="p개 층마다. 증거가 쌓이면 좁히거나 갈아엎는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="936" width="672" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="892" y="1064" width="756" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5nt" value="DataSTORM 의 thesis 는 &quot;서사 수렴&quot; 이 목적이다. 우리는 여기에 반증 가능성을 얹는다 — 게시된 설명이 MTS 로 나가므로 검증 안 된 추측이 흘러가면 안 된다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="904" y="1072" width="732" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a8443f;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1692" y="660" width="880" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#a8443f;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1692" y="660" width="880" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6n" value="⑦ Adversary" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1708" y="668" width="730" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6k" value="LLM · 별도 컨텍스트" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2432" y="672" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l716" value="목적" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="716" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b716" value="논제를 죽이러 온다. 생존한 것만 통과시킨다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="716" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l744" value="입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="744" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b744" value="t_i + B_i &lt;b&gt;만&lt;/b&gt;. 생성 측 추론 이력은 받지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="744" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l772" value="출력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="772" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b772" value="㉠ 반례 (근거 있는 것)  ㉡ 대안 설명  ㉢ 범위 축소 요구  ㉣ 판정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="772" width="772" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l800" value="왜 컨텍스트를&lt;br&gt;끊나" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="800" width="74" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b800" value="자기 가설을 자기 컨텍스트에서 반증하면 형식적 반증만 나온다.&lt;br&gt;v1 에서 실제로 관측됨 — &quot;T1 로 기각했다&quot; 고 썼는데 T1 이 실행조차&lt;br&gt;안 됐다. 코드가 invalid_rejections 로 잡아냈다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="800" width="772" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l860" value="도구" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="860" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b860" value="Executor·Quant Executor 를 직접 호출할 수 있다.&lt;br&gt;반례는 주장이 아니라 &lt;b&gt;실행된 근거&lt;/b&gt;여야 한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="860" width="772" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l904" value="루프" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="904" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b904" value="기각 → Planner 재탐색. &lt;b&gt;최대 2왕복.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3회차에도 안 서면 근거가 없는 것 → UNCERTAIN" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="904" width="772" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6l948" value="자동 기각" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a8443f;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1706" y="948" width="74" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6b948" value="· 반증 조건 없음&lt;br&gt;· 지목한 event_id 가 PIT 창 밖&lt;br&gt;· 실행되지 않은 검정을 근거로 인용" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1786" y="948" width="772" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6nb" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#e0b0b0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1704" y="1064" width="856" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6nt" value="v1 실패 B7 관련 — 정직 &gt; 커버리지. 수렴하지 않으면 UNCERTAIN 이 정답이다. 채점에서 기권은 0 bit 라 손해가 없다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a3532;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1716" y="1072" width="832" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7b5ba6;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1170" width="1230" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#7b5ba6;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1170" width="1230" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7n" value="보고 생성 5단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1178" width="1080" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7k" value="LLM · 편집 파이프라인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1138" y="1182" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1226" value="왜 5단인가" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1226" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1226" value="한 번에 쓰면 (1) 인용 없는 주장 (2) 인용 나열로 때우기 (3) 서사 붕괴 —&lt;br&gt;논문이 관측한 세 가지 실패가 그대로 난다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1226" width="1122" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1270" value="A 개요" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1270" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1270" value="절마다 서사 목적 · 필요 근거 Bˢ ⊆ B · 핵심 논점을 먼저 못박는다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1270" width="1122" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1298" value="B 초안" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1298" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1298" value="절을 &lt;b&gt;독립&lt;/b&gt;으로 쓴다. 각 절은 자기 근거 부분집합에만 접지된다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1298" width="1122" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1326" value="C 사실검증" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1326" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1326" value="인용 경계로 문장을 쪼개, 인용이 뒷받침하지 못하는 주장을 표시한다.&lt;br&gt;이 단계가 없으면 날조 인용이 대량 발생한다 (논문 인용 2건)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1326" width="1122" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1370" value="D 수정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1370" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1370" value="수집된 비판으로 절을 고쳐 쓴다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1370" width="1122" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1398" value="E 통합" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1398" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1398" value="절을 합쳐 최종 설명 패킷. 여기서만 전역 문체를 손댄다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1398" width="1122" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7l1426" value="산출" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7b5ba6;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="1426" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7b1426" value="설명 패킷 = 주장 + 지목 event_id + 크기 구간 + 반증 조건 + lineage" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#3d6e28;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="142" y="1426" width="1122" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6b6b6b;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="1170" width="620" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#6b6b6b;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="1170" width="620" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8n" value="Insight Bank" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1326" y="1178" width="470" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8k" value="저장소 · LLM 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1790" y="1182" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8l1226" value="무엇" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1324" y="1226" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8b1226" value="층을 가로지르는 근거 은행 B_i" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="1226" width="512" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8l1254" value="한 건의 형태" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1324" y="1254" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8b1254" value="(주장, 수치, 근거 SQL/코드, 출처 event_id, 층)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="1254" width="512" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8l1282" value="통합" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1324" y="1282" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8b1282" value="새 근거를 기존과 병합. 상한 유지.&lt;br&gt;약한 근거는 강한 것에 &lt;b&gt;밀려난다&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="1282" width="512" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8l1326" value="쓰임" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1324" y="1326" width="74" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8b1326" value="· Planner 의 다음 질문 재료&lt;br&gt;· Query Consistency 의 기준 질의 참조&lt;br&gt;· Thesis 의 입력&lt;br&gt;· 보고 A단계의 근거 배분 대상" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="1326" width="512" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8l1402" value="불변식" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1324" y="1402" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8b1402" value="은행에 없는 것은 보고에 쓸 수 없다.&lt;br&gt;모든 문장이 은행 항목으로 역추적된다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="1402" width="512" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6b6b6b;strokeWidth=3;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1962" y="1170" width="610" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9h" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#6b6b6b;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1962" y="1170" width="610" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9n" value="전역 규약" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1978" y="1178" width="460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9k" value="하네스 · LLM 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2432" y="1182" width="124" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9l1226" value="PIT 방화벽" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="1226" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9b1226" value="τ = 설명 대상 시각. 이후 데이터 전면 차단.&lt;br&gt;실현 r₁·r₂·route 는 탐색 중 비공개 — 채점에서만 열린다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="1226" width="502" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9l1270" value="디코이" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="1270" width="74" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9b1270" value="사건 없는 셀 ~10% 혼입. 설명을 지어내는지 잡는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="1270" width="502" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9l1298" value="라벨" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="1298" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9b1298" value="daum_rel/daum_mat/mat_typ 영구 차단 (LabelLeak).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;채점 타깃도 아니다&lt;/b&gt; — 그건 주석자 흉내내기였다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="1298" width="502" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9l1342" value="정지" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="1342" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9b1342" value="층 상한 m · Adversary 왕복 2 · 도구 호출 상한&lt;br&gt;미수렴 → UNCERTAIN (0 bit, 손해 없음)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="1342" width="502" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9l1386" value="lineage" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="1386" width="74" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9b1386" value="모든 수치에 그것을 낸 SQL/코드가 붙는다.&lt;br&gt;자기보고 수치 금지 — v1 세션에서 8% 어긋났다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="1386" width="502" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="foot" value="형식 제약을 없앤 대신 세 가지로 묶는다 —  ① PIT 방화벽(미래 차단)  ② Adversary(반증 강제)  ③ 실현 가격 채점(자기보고 배제)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#3d6e28;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1620" width="2100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="foot2" value="자유는 가설과 검정의 &lt;b&gt;모양&lt;/b&gt;에만 준다. 접지·반증·채점은 코드가 쥔다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1656" width="2100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>